  "title": "Quick and Easy Black Bean Soup",
  "description": "All you need is a couple cans of beans, an onion, some bacon, and spices to whip up this simple but delicious soup.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2012-02-10T12:02:51-05:00",
